<p begin="00:01:54.079" end="00:01:59.920" style="s2">&quot;Oh, I didn&#39;t know he played football.&quot;</p>
<p begin="00:01:56.720" end="00:02:01.759" style="s2">And then he said, &quot;No, he was great. We</p>
<p begin="00:01:59.920" end="00:02:03.280" style="s2">had the championship team. We won the</p>
