<p begin="00:02:09.599" end="00:02:16.040" style="s2">he tackled people, he&#39;d rip their heads</p>
<p begin="00:02:13.040" end="00:02:16.040" style="s2">off.</p>
<p begin="00:02:16.560" end="00:02:20.160" style="s2">And I&#39;ve known Jo, you know, he&#39;s been</p>
<p begin="00:02:18.160" end="00:02:21.680" style="s2">my friend for a long time.</p>
<p begin="00:02:20.160" end="00:02:22.959" style="s2">You know, see, if I were him, I would</p>
<p begin="00:02:21.680" end="00:02:25.760" style="s2">have said I was one of the greatest</p>
<p begin="00:02:22.959" end="00:02:28.239" style="s2">players ever to come out of Ohio.</p>
<p begin="00:02:25.760" end="00:02:30.080" style="s2">He doesn&#39;t do that. He&#39;s a humble guy.</p>
<p begin="00:02:28.239" end="00:02:32.720" style="s2">So, he didn&#39;t talk about it. It took</p>
