<p begin="00:02:55.120" end="00:03:01.080" style="s2">by the way, the whole championship. And</p>
<p begin="00:02:57.599" end="00:03:01.080" style="s2">he was the best.</p>
<p begin="00:03:03.280" end="00:03:09.040" style="s2">And he set the NCAA record. He&#39;s a</p>
<p begin="00:03:06.000" end="00:03:12.879" style="s2">safety for interception 17. I said, &quot;You</p>
