<p begin="00:04:58.560" end="00:05:03.880" style="s2">Paid protesters.</p>
<p begin="00:05:00.479" end="00:05:03.880" style="s2">Paid protesters.</p>
<p begin="00:05:11.600" end="00:05:16.560" style="s2">USA. USA. USA.</p>
